#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:2
msgid "M5UI"
msgstr "M5UI"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"M5UI is a UI library based on LVGL v9.3. It provides a set of widgets and"
" functions to create user interfaces for M5Stack devices."
msgstr "M5UI 是一个基于 LVGL v9.3 的 UI 库。它提供了一组用于创建 M5Stack 设备用户界面的小部件和函数。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"It has been adapted for M5Stack devices and you only need to call "
"``m5ui.init()`` to start using it."
msgstr "它已适用于 M5Stack 设备，您只需调用 ``m5ui.init()`` 即可开始使用它。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:12
msgid "Supported Controllers"
msgstr "支持的主机"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"The current UiFlow2 firmware enables both LVGL and M5UI on the following "
"9 controllers:"
msgstr "当前 UiFlow2 固件在以下 9 款主机上同时启用了 LVGL 和 M5UI："

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:16
msgid "Core2 (``M5STACK_Core2``)"
msgstr "Core2 (``M5STACK_Core2``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:17
msgid "CoreS3 (``M5STACK_CoreS3``)"
msgstr "CoreS3 (``M5STACK_CoreS3``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:18
msgid "M5Dial (``M5STACK_Dial``)"
msgstr "M5Dial (``M5STACK_Dial``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:19
msgid "StackChan (``M5STACK_StackChan``)"
msgstr "StackChan (``M5STACK_StackChan``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:20
msgid "StopWatch (``M5STACK_StopWatch``)"
msgstr "StopWatch (``M5STACK_StopWatch``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:21
msgid "Tab5 (``M5STACK_Tab5``)"
msgstr "Tab5 (``M5STACK_Tab5``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:22
msgid "Tab5X (``M5STACK_Tab5X``; inherits the Tab5 LVGL and M5UI configuration)"
msgstr "Tab5X (``M5STACK_Tab5X``；继承 Tab5 的 LVGL 和 M5UI 配置)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:23
msgid "Tough (``M5STACK_Tough``)"
msgstr "Tough (``M5STACK_Tough``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:24
msgid "ToughC5 (``M5STACK_ToughC5``)"
msgstr "ToughC5 (``M5STACK_ToughC5``)"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:27
msgid "M5 Series Display Libraries"
msgstr "M5 系列显示库说明"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid "1. Display (M5.Lcd)"
msgstr "显示"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"A low-level graphics library providing basic screen drawing, text, lines,"
" and color management."
msgstr "底层图形库，提供屏幕绘制、文字、线条、颜色管理等基础功能。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Can be used independently, suitable for scenarios that only require "
"drawing graphics or text."
msgstr "可独立使用，适合只需要绘制图形或文字的场景。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Access via**: ``M5.Lcd.fillRect()``, ``M5.Lcd.drawRect()``, "
"``M5.Lcd.drawString()``, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:36
#, fuzzy
msgid "2. Widgets (M5.Widgets)"
msgstr "2. 控件"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"A basic UI widget library providing labels, image displays, and other UI "
"controls."
msgstr "基础控件库，提供标签、图片显示等 UI 控件。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:38
msgid "Built on top of M5GFX."
msgstr "底层依赖 M5GFX。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:39
msgid "Suitable for simple interactive UI elements."
msgstr "适合需要简单交互控件的界面。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Access via**: ``M5.Widgets.Label()``, ``M5.Widgets.Image()``, "
"``M5.Widgets.Rectangle()``, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Important**: ``M5.Widgets`` provides UI component **classes**, not "
"drawing methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Recommendation**: For new interactive UI projects, prefer M5UI/LVGL. "
"Use M5.Widgets for simple or legacy UI components."
msgstr "**建议**：新建交互式 UI 项目时优先使用 M5UI/LVGL。M5.Widgets 适用于简单或旧版 UI 组件。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:45
msgid "3. M5UI"
msgstr "3. M5UI"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:46
msgid "A high-level UI framework based on LVGL."
msgstr "高层 UI 框架，基于 LVGL 封装。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:47
msgid ""
"Provides page management, multi-widget layouts, and unified event "
"handling."
msgstr "提供页面管理、多控件布局和统一事件处理。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:48
msgid "**Recommendation**: Prefer M5UI/LVGL for new interactive UI projects."
msgstr "**建议**：新建交互式 UI 项目优先使用 M5UI/LVGL。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Access via**: ``m5ui.M5Label()``, ``m5ui.M5Button()``, "
"``m5ui.M5Page()``, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:52
msgid "Usage Tips"
msgstr "使用提示"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"⚠️ Do not mix M5GFX, M5Widgets, and M5UI simultaneously, as it may cause "
"rendering issues or event conflicts."
msgstr "⚠️ 不建议同时混用 M5GFX、M5Widgets、M5UI，可能导致渲染异常或事件冲突。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:54
#, fuzzy
msgid "For graphics-only drawing → use M5GFX (M5.Lcd)."
msgstr "单独绘图 → 使用 M5GFX。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:55
msgid "For simple interactive widgets → use M5Widgets."
msgstr "简单控件交互 → 使用 M5Widgets。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:56
msgid "For multi-page UI → use M5UI/LVGL (recommended for new projects)."
msgstr "多页面 UI → 使用 M5UI/LVGL（新项目推荐）。"

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:59
msgid "Common Mistakes to Avoid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:60
msgid ""
"❌ **WRONG**: ``Widgets.fillRect()`` or ``Widgets.drawRect()`` - These "
"methods do not exist in Widgets module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"✅ **CORRECT**: ``M5.Lcd.fillRect()`` or ``M5.Lcd.drawRect()`` - Use "
"M5.Lcd for drawing methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:62
msgid ""
"❌ **WRONG**: Mixing ``M5.Widgets.Rectangle()`` with ``m5ui.M5Page()`` - "
"Different UI systems, don't mix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"✅ **CORRECT**: Use either M5.Widgets OR m5ui consistently, not both "
"together"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Key Distinction**: - ``M5.Lcd`` = Drawing methods (fillRect, drawRect, "
"drawCircle, drawString, etc.) - ``M5.Widgets`` = Simple UI component "
"classes (Label, Image, Rectangle, Circle, etc.) - ``m5ui`` = LVGL-based "
"UI framework (M5Label, M5Button, M5Page, M5Chart, etc.)"
msgstr ""

